<title>USA: Palm Harbor Q2 Sept 27 shr $0.42 vs $0.30.</title>
<headline>Palm Harbor Q2 Sept 27 shr $0.42 vs $0.30.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>PALM HARBOR HOMES, INC.</p>
<p>						   Second Quarter Ended</p>
<p>						  Sep 27,	   Sep 29,</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p> Net sales			     $152,717,000    $103,247,000</p>
<p> Net income				 6,301,000	 3,617,000</p>
